# CapNet Quickstart - 60 Second Demo
# Quick demonstration of core functionality

Output demos/capnet-quickstart.mp4

Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Molokai"

Type "# CapNet - Capability-based authorization for AI agents"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# Install and run in 60 seconds:"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "git clone https://github.com/Connerlevi/CapNET"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "cd CapNET"
Enter
Sleep 500ms

Type "npm install"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "npm run dev"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# In another terminal:"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "npm run demo"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Type "# ✓ Agent allowed to buy groceries ($14.47)"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# ✗ Agent blocked from buying alcohol"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# ✗ Agent stopped after capability revoked"
Enter
Sleep 2s

Type "# The leash works. Agents can act, but only within bounds."
Enter
Sleep 3s
